      "Integration tests need make build first, then PATH=\"$PWD/cmd/ipfs:$PATH\" and an isolated IPFS_PATH.",
      "Do not run make test or make test_sharness unless asked; prefer targeted tests.",
      "Run ipfs daemon only with a timeout, on non-default ports with its own IPFS_PATH."
